{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089070/extras/64d19c18c56e0304f5ad65f70171cd5c.avif?t=1767140102\" alt=\"How far would you go to prove your innocence?\" width=1000 height=270 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milan has it all. Caring parents, good grades, and friends (or acquaintances, as he prefers to call them). But everything he knows collapses when he becomes the sole suspect in the brutal murder of his parents, with every piece of evidence pointing toward him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089070/extras/c244e7ddced63931ce6332746676f932.avif?t=1767140102\" alt=\"In order to prove his innocence\" width=1000 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milan must unravel the lies and secrets behind the murder. But the deeper he digs, the harder it becomes to trust anyone \u2014 even himself. Is he truly innocent, or is there an ugly truth hidden beneath the cracks of reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Time Crack </i>is a mystery and psychological thriller visual novel about truth, trust, and doubt. Follow Milan\u2019s choices, investigations, and discoveries in the search for the truth \u2014 and only the truth. Will you uncover it\u2026 or be destroyed by it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089070/extras/cdfbe7c4d9565a5ff7f4b3ce536bb6bb.avif?t=1767140102\" alt=\"Key features\" width=1000 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>~6-8 hours of gameplay</strong> (70-80K words) depending on your choices. Immerse yourself in a suspenseful narrative full of twists and dark secrets.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Multiple endings and routes</strong>. Your choices matter in <i>Time Crack</i>. Which ending will you reach, and what sacrifices must be made along the way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Original, scene-specific CG illustrations</strong>.<i> Time Crack</i> doesn't hold back on depicting blood, corpses, and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Interactive investigation segments</strong>. Search for clues and evidence in pursuit of the truth. Who killed Milan's parents? It's up to you to find out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Choose between Gameplay Mode and Narration Mode.</strong>\u00a0If you prefer to just read,\u00a0<i>Time Crack</i> can be played entirely without choices and investigations. Follow the canon route without additional branching!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4089070?t=1767140102","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089070/106041a3efe49b46c39dbfedc05ee8cc331d409a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767140102","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089070/b97e7afc4dc3b94689b2c4a28668d26966719c9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767140102","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089070/b97e7afc4dc3b94689b2c4a28668d26966719c9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767140102","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial C